# Layer 6 (CR 613.1f), AddKeyword$ through the whole combat. Knighthood's
# S:Mode$ Continuous | Affected$ Creature.YouCtrl | AddKeyword$ First Strike
# gives Silvercoat Lion (2/2) first strike. Grizzly Bears (2/2) blocks: without
# the keyword both would die in the one regular damage step; with it the Lion
# deals its 2 damage in the first-strike step, the state-based-action check
# kills the Bears, and they never deal damage back.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
firststrikedamage
advance
combatdamage
